window.products.push({"id":583219,"name":"9 Pcs Silicone Cooking Kitchen Utensils Set Stainless Steel Silicone Kitchen Utensil Set Silicone Utensil Set Spatula Set Non-stick Heat Resistant Sil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cys7Peu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What Makes JIIKOOAI Silicone Kitchen Utensil Set Different? * The heads with food-grade silicone, and tough nylon core to provide perfect balance and strength. * The handle made of high-quality stainless steel. which not only looks great, it also gives each utensil a satisfying weight and feel, combined with fantastic strength and durability. * The grip with silicone coated, making it comfortable to hold.   QUALITY MEETS STYLE - Made of safe food grade BPA free silicone material and durable 304 stainless steel, our cooking utensils tools exhibit a good-textured and classic trait SAFETY MATTERS - The anti-scratch silicone heads of our utensils will protect your non-stick cookware from any scratches and damages, such as saucepans, frying pans and pots and thus extend their service life CONSIDERATE DESIGN - Our silicone cooking utensils are lightweight and easy to hold, and its silicone handle offers you a comfortable grip so that you won't get tired during long-time cooking EASY MAINTENANCE - The whole kitchen utensil set can both be washed in dishwasher or hand-washed as you like, there is also a little loop at the top for hanging and drying after cleaning. Material: Silicone and stainless steel Package size: 14.6’’ x 4.5’’ x 4.5’’ (L x W x H) Package includes： 1 X Skimmer 1 X Soup Ladle 1 X Pasta Server 1 X Slotted Turner 1 X Solid Spoon 1 X Food Turner 1 X Whisk 1 X Tongs 1 X Holder  If you have any question, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cys7Peu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIIKOOAI","source_asin":"B086J3MJ5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-583219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086J3MJ5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086J3MJ5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":583220,"name":"Sobeeting Dining Room Chair Slipcovers Stretch Parson Chair Protector Kitchen Chair Covers Super Fit Removable Washable Printed Armless Chair Covers f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PArAuqe+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Great Quality Material】The Sobeeting stretch kitchen chair cover is made of the best polyester and spandex. After modern technology and unique design, the fabric becomes soft, breathable, comfortable and wear-resistant. Elastic straps are sewn on the bottom hem, which is more suitable for chairs than ordinary dining chair slipcovers. 【Perfect Protection】The jacquard chair covers for dining room can better protect your chair from food soup, abrasion, children's graffiti and pet scratches. The high stretchy slipcovers can also cover the scratches and stains on the old chair, making the old chair new and more beautiful, saving you the cost of replacing the chair. 【Suitable Size for Armless Chair】The height: 17.7-23.6 inches (45-60 cm), the thickness: 1.5-4 inches (5-10 cm), the width : 15.7-19.7 inches (40-50 cm), The length: 15.7-19.7 inches (40-50 cm). What needs to be reminded is that the chair covers are measured manually, and there will be an error of 0.5-1inches. 【Multi-scene Use】The Parsons chair protector cover is suitable for most backrest chairs and can be widely used in different occasions, such as kitchens, dining rooms, living rooms, hotels, celebrations, coffee shops and so on. You can choose suitable and removable chair slipcovers to decorate ordinary chairs according to different scenes and atmospheres. 【Installation and Wash】The detachable chair cover with great quality is very easy to install and remove, and it is more convenient to clean. You only need to put the dirty seat slipcover sets into the washing machine, add neutral detergent, without bleaching and ironing. After airing or drying, the stretch dining chair cover will be clean and not deformed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PArAuqe+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sobeeting","source_asin":"B091GS25PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-583220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091GS25PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091GS25PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
