window.products.push({"id":583448,"name":"HOMFINE Cooling Blanket Tie Dye with Double Sided Cold Effect - Lightweight Breathable Summer Blankets for Bed, Transfer Heat to Keep Body Cool for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ugZpAEfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOMFINE has always been committed to creating the most comfortable sleep for customers, and finally, the summer cooling blanket with decorative tie-dye process was born! Not only does it have a luxurious look but it also gives you a longer-lasting coolness. 【Arc-Chill Long-Lasting Cooling Tech】Made with Japanese latest Q-Max>0.45 Arc-Chill cooling fiber, it quickly absorbs body heat and transfers it out while you sleep. The moment the skin touches the cooling blanket, the temperature on the body surface can be reduced by more than 5°C. A tie-dye cool blanket is a great help for night sweats and hot sleepers – it will keep you cool and dry all night. 【Double-Sided Cooling Design】This double-sided cooled blanket is topped with mica nylon and polyethylene for skin-friendly softness and is very comfortable for spring and autumn use. The underside is made of 100% mica nylon fabric, which is cool and breathable, suitable for hot summer days. It also automatically adjusts the cooling temperature based on your body temperature, making it perfect for the whole family to help you relax and sleep better every night. 【The Best Solution for Stay Cool in Summer】Innovative cooling technology allows our cooling blankets to have larger cooling holes than regular blankets, quickly removing heat-absorbing moisture, keeping you cool, dry and comfortable overnight. HOMFINE cooling comforter will not harm your sensitive skin and are suitable for the delicate skin of cats, dogs and babies. 【Versatile Usage Scenarios】Provide 5 different sizes and colors, you can choose according to the size of the bed and the decor of your room. [Throw - 50\"x70\"] [Twin - 60\"x90\"] [Queen - 90 x90\"] [King - 108 x90\"] & [Gray] [Blue] [Yellow] [Pink]. Tie-dye cooling blanket is so light that you can use it in your bedroom, camping, traveling, car or plane. Our cooling blankets are also an ideal gift choice for birthdays Christmas for those family and friends with night sweats and hot sleep. 【Easy Care & Durable】Thanks to high-strength weaves and high-quality fabrics, this hot sleeper blanket is machine and hand washable. No fading, shrinkage and pilling. We recommend using a mild detergent and placing it in a laundry bag to prevent tangling and damage. Washing and maintenance instructions: 30°C light washing, do not bleach, do not iron, do not dry clean, dry clean, dry in a cool place. 【Worry-Free Satisfaction Service】We offer 30 days free returns and exchanges. If you have any questions when you receive the product, please feel free to contact us, we will solve the problem for you immediately. We will ensure you have a pleasant shopping experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ugZpAEfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMFINE","source_asin":"B0BM35FMRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-583448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM35FMRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM35FMRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
