window.products.push({"id":583485,"name":"NatraProw Bento Box for Adult, 1200 ML Lunch Containers for Adults, LeakProof Lunch Box with Utensils, BPA Free, 3 Compartment Bento Box Microwave Saf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713TlGTFDBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portion Control/Food Separation】NatraProw bento lunch box has 3 compartments to keep different types of food in the whole container, keeping the nutrition balance and original taste, So your prep bento is healthier and tastier than fast food, you can save money on your lunch box in one week. 【Humanized Design Lunch Containers】Adult lunch boxes are made of food-grade safety materials, BPA-free; Even can easily open or close the latch on the lid, utensils embedded in lid perfectly avoid contacting with your food and forgetting utensils, really thoughtful innovative design. 【Dishwasher and Microwave Safe】The reusable bento box lunch box is easy to use, easy to clean, supports microwave heating (lid not included) and dishwasher cleaning (top rack only, hand washing of lid and utensils is recommended to avoid deformation caused by high temperature). 【Leak-Proof/High Quality】The silicone strip provides a good airtight seal for the lunch box, the outer seal holds everything in VERY well. so you don't have to worry about food leaks even when carrying it for long distances; and the 4 user-friendly latches feature a roller design that greatly increases the lifespan. Note: The internal compartments are not completely sealed from each other, so food with soup is not very recommended. 【Portable Lunch Boxes】The bento lunch box has the perfect size (9.1 x 6.5 x 2.7 inches) to hold up to 1200ML / 5.07 cups of food, yet stays compact and easily fits in your lunch bag for easy portability. For older and adults who can also eat well at work,What's more, the lovely Morandi colors add a fun twist to a bland lunch and make it look even more delicious! 【What You Get】NatraProw 40.58oz adult lunch box, fork, spoon, chopsticks, cutter. 6 months unconditional return policy, 7*24 hours customer support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713TlGTFDBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NatraProw","source_asin":"B09H5N6XQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-583485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H5N6XQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H5N6XQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
