window.products.push({"id":583686,"name":"Handmade Swedish Gnome, Scandinavian Tomte, Yule Santa Nisse, Nordic Figurine, Plush Elf Toy, Winter Home Table Ornament, Christmas Decorations, Holid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Duz+PP+oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A LUCKY GNOME --- Gnome or Tomte, according to Scandinavian folklore, he is elderly, with a long beard, as the traditional talisman for the house. The Tomte is reputed to safeguard the farms, family and children, particularly at night, protecting them from misfortune. Gnomes are best known for guarding Earthly treasures and are perfect for protecting your Christmas goodies and adding some whimsy to your holiday decor. PERFECT GIFT --- Gnome is a traditionalist and perfect for spreading Holiday spirit. Put him in the entrance, under the Christmas tree or decorate the Nursery with it and it will bring a look of fairy tale warmth and coziness. He would be the festive addition to your shelf & table and home decoration. Gnomes are perfect gifts for family & friends' home at Christmas/ Festival day and Party time! Speak to the dwarf any desire you wish - he will try to make it come true. DIMENSION & MATERIAL --- Wears red knitted hat with adorable dangling legs. 21 inches tall from boot to top of the hat, 4 inches wide. His tall traditional knitted hat hides his eyes & ears safe from the cold. The Fiber fur long white & grey beard and resin nose are well-known traits of the cunning gnome. Bendable wire in his ridiculously tall hat in order to pose it for maximum whimsy and ridiculousness! Features weighted bottom for extra stability and legs are designed to dangle and swing. PACKAGE INCLUDED --- ITOMTE series products brochure x 1 (with promotional information & gnome's adventure story), gnome/ tomte x 1 (with an exclusive tag of ITOMTE), box printed ITOMTE brand x1. Please be sure that your gnomes are come in a box with ITOMTE name, with a view to avoid a mistaken purchase of infringing product and without any guarantee by ITOMTE. Search and Follow ITOMTE official accounts to win promotion code or mystery grab bag for free, or log in as member on www.itomte.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Duz+PP+oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ITOMTE","source_asin":"B07VDQ4TKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-583686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VDQ4TKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VDQ4TKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
