window.products.push({"id":583892,"name":"Elbaz Lauren 36 Inch Round Polish Lace Table Topper Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m9-2uJpkL._AC_.jpg","description":"For the look and feel of elegance comes the Elbaz \"Lauren\" 36\" Round Table Topper, Ivory in color. A perennial favorite among lovers of flowers and fine table textiles is the rose. And this collection featuring the rose has remained popular for many years - because the motif is a simple expression of a classic floral design with universal appeal. Along with impressive weight and texture, Rose lace has a large central medallion of roses with ornate scalloped edges that give it a distinctive tabletop silhouette. A truly exquisite traditional design! Made in Poland, this is Double Jacquard lace, which is heavier with more threads to the inch and gives greater definition of the pattern. 100% polyester and machine washable, it has amazing stain release capabilities and becomes softer with repeated washings. This Elbaz Lauren Lace 36\" Round Ivory Table Topper is Brand New in the Package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m9-2uJpkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elbaz Lauren","source_asin":"B00OQQB9QS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-583892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OQQB9QS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OQQB9QS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
